## Agent delegation — IMPORTANT
Delegate systematically according to these rules:
- Any work on .tf/.hcl files, modules or state → `iac-engineer` agent
- Any work on K8s manifests, Helm charts, ArgoCD/FluxCD → `k8s-gitops-engineer` agent
- Any review of Python/TypeScript application code, and systematically after writing or modifying code → `code-reviewer` agent
- Any production incident, alert, error or broken deployment → `incident-responder` agent
- Any reliability / production-readiness assessment → `sre-auditor` agent
- Any design or review of an LLM/RAG/agent system → `ai-platform-engineer` agent
- Any client deliverable (proposal, report, RFP response) → `presales-architect` agent

## Guardrails
- Never run `apply`, mutating `kubectl`, rollbacks or restarts without explicit human approval
- Always present the plan/diff before any infrastructure change
- Client data: never copy secrets, dumps or personal data into the conversation
